  "stem": "The function \\(g\\) is defined by \\(g(x) = 4(3)^{x}\\). What is the value of \\(g(2) - g(1)\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "24"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "\\(g(2) = 4(3)^{2} = 4(9) = 36\\) and \\(g(1) = 4(3)^{1} = 12\\).",
    "\\(g(2) - g(1) = 36 - 12 = 24\\)."
  ],
